382c959b-d9c8-4c9f-a85e-bf7682ffb23c	\N	The Family Tree — Extended	1	\N	\r\n# 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 The Family Tree\r\n\r\n| Dutch | English |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| vader / papa | father / dad |\r\n| moeder / mama | mother / mom |\r\n| broer | brother |\r\n| zus | sister |\r\n| zoon | son |\r\n| dochter | daughter |\r\n| kind | child |\r\n| opa / grootvader | grandpa |\r\n| oma / grootmoeder | grandma |\r\n| oom | uncle |\r\n| tante | aunt |\r\n| neef | nephew / male cousin |\r\n| nicht | niece / female cousin |\r\n| schoonvader | father-in-law |\r\n| schoonmoeder | mother-in-law |\r\n| zwager | brother-in-law |\r\n| schoonzus | sister-in-law |\r\n\r\n> neef / nicht cover BOTH cousin AND nephew/niece.\r\n\r\n> ✍️ WRITE THIS DOWN: "schoon-" prefix = "in-law". schoonvader = father-in-law.\r\n  	2026-10-14 12:20:07.332137+00	4c8c36c7-a3b0-4f04-be79-f82395f1ce23	f	80
91923902-d1a1-486e-b741-aaee9f882d4f	\N	Mission 3 Recap — Everyday Communicator	1	\N	\r\n# 🎯 Mission 3 Recap\r\n\r\n| Area | Content |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Time | Numbers, days, months, hours, dates |\r\n| Food | Supermarket, restaurant, quantities, money |\r\n| Family | Full tree, home, routine, chores |\r\n| Modals | kunnen, moeten, willen, mogen, zullen, blijven |\r\n\r\n## Modals\r\n\r\n| Dutch | Meaning | ik-form |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| kunnen | can | kan |\r\n| moeten | must | moet |\r\n| willen | want | wil |\r\n| mogen | may | mag |\r\n| zullen | shall | zal |\r\n| blijven | stay | blijf |\r\n\r\n## Rule\r\n\r\nModal in position 2 → infinitive at the END.\r\n\r\n- Ik wil een boek lezen.\r\n\r\n## Real-World Polish\r\n\r\n- Ik wil graag een koffie.\r\n- Zou u me kunnen helpen?\r\n- Hoeveel kost het?\r\n- Mag ik de rekening?\r\n\r\n> ✍️ WRITE THIS DOWN: Mission 3 gave you NUMBERS, TIME, FOOD, FAMILY, MODALS. You can navigate daily Dutch life.\r\n  	2026-10-14 12:20:30.40298+00	efb3fb26-4cec-40f9-bc1b-200f950c4520	f	80
