COPY "public"."study_specs" ("id", "category", "title", "description", "objective", "methodology", "prompt", "created_at") FROM stdin;
51b1e61d-0d8e-4f01-9a0e-ca151a4ef27e	Learning Specs	The Feynman Extractor	Understand complex concepts by explaining them simply.	Break down a complex topic into its foundational components.	1. Choose concept. 2. Explain simply. 3. Identify gaps. 4. Refine.	Act as a world-class teacher using the Feynman Technique. I want to understand [Concept]. 1. Explain it as if I am 12. 2. Identify misconceptions. 3. Give a physical analogy. 4. Ask 3 test questions.	2026-11-05 10:05:31.993053+00
87529967-be5a-4501-a9be-5ab5a82f2836	Learning Specs	The Socratic Questioner	Challenge assumptions to reach the root of understanding.	Force deep reasoning by systematically questioning every claim.	1. State claim. 2. Ask clarifying questions. 3. Probe assumptions.	Act as a Socratic philosopher. I will present a belief about [Topic]. Question me relentlessly to expose logical gaps, hidden assumptions, and contradictory definitions until we reach first principles.	2026-11-05 10:05:31.993053+00
766a0893-42bb-45b8-b10a-138bdeb610d1	Learning Specs	The Mental Model Cartographer	Map new information to existing mental models.	Prevent isolated facts by immediately integrating new data into a larger framework.	1. Identify concept. 2. Identify existing models. 3. Draw connections.	I am learning about [New Concept]. Act as a systems architect. Map this concept to 3 familiar mental models (e.g., biology, architecture, mechanics). Explain the structural similarities and where the analogy breaks down.	2026-11-05 10:05:31.993053+00
1da447a0-a895-4e1b-8565-abe7717ce294	Learning Specs	The 80/20 Curriculum	Extract the most critical 20% of a subject.	Filter out the noise and focus on the core mechanics.	1. Define goal. 2. Identify core sub-skills. 3. Focus only on high-leverage.	Act as a curriculum designer applying the Pareto Principle. I want to learn [Skill]. Identify the essential 20% of concepts that will give me 80% of the practical capability. Create a 4-week deep dive syllabus focusing ONLY on those items.	2026-11-05 10:05:31.993053+00
0c65e48b-9020-47ec-9869-601ba99601a2	Learning Specs	The Spaced Repetition Architect	Design a schedule to move knowledge to long-term memory.	Beat the forgetting curve using scientifically backed intervals.	1. Select material. 2. Create flashcards. 3. Schedule reviews.	I need to memorize [Subject]. Act as a cognitive scientist. Generate 10 high-yield flashcards (Question on front, detailed answer on back). Then, provide a specific spaced repetition schedule to ensure 100% retention over 30 days.	2026-11-05 10:05:31.993053+00
e405be32-7167-432d-85d6-aaf923edeefc	Learning Specs	The Active Recall Engine	Test understanding instead of passively reading.	Transform reading material into a testing engine.	1. Read material. 2. Close book. 3. Write down everything.	Act as a strict examiner. I just read an article about [Topic]. Based on my text, ask me the 5 most difficult questions that require me to synthesize the information. Wait for my answers, then grade them.	2026-11-05 10:05:31.993053+00
765d82c6-bd54-481f-a90d-ac01ad78226d	Research Specs	The First Principles Deconstructor	Break any argument down to its fundamental truths.	Strip away assumptions and analogies to find objective truth.	1. Identify paradigm. 2. Strip assumptions. 3. Find truths.	Act as a First Principles thinker. I am researching [Topic]. 1. Deconstruct this topic into 5 undeniable truths. 2. Identify assumptions people make that are unproven. 3. Build a logical argument using only the truths.	2026-11-05 10:05:31.993053+00
